Falsifies `inter_process_communication::verification::receive_preserves_the_invariant`.

The defect: collecting the last sender leaves the tag on an empty sender queue, the mirror of the
slip `send_preserves_the_invariant.patch` injects and in the mirror function. Kept as its own
record rather than folded into one, because each harness is evidence about its own operation and
a shared patch would leave either one unable to say it had been falsified.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(e.one_queue_invariant_holds())`, on a rendezvous seeded
with one sender and no pending signal, after the receive collects it. The rendezvous would call
itself busy with nobody on it.

